  <p class="label">Our story</p>
  <h1>Books that take small readers seriously</h1>
</div>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:1rem;">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="hero-lede">Roaring Kids Press is an independent children's book publisher built on a simple belief: the big feelings of small kids deserve big, beautiful stories.</p>

    <p>We publish picture books and early readers that don't rush past a child's fear, frustration, or first-time nerves. Instead, our stories sit with those feelings, add a little humor and a lot of heart, and let kids arrive at courage on their own terms.</p>

    <h2>What we make</h2>
    <p>Our books are organized into character-led series, so a child can grow up alongside a friend they recognize from book to book. Our first character is Zavi — a small boy with a big imagination — and his companion Momos. More characters and worlds are on the way.</p>

    <h2>Our promise</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Stories that honor emotions instead of fixing them in a hurry.</li>
      <li>Warm, expressive art that kids want to linger over.</li>
      <li>Age-appropriate language, carefully leveled for each series.</li>
      <li>Characters and worlds worth returning to, again and again.</li>
    </ul>

    <p style="margin-top:2rem;"><a class="btn" href="/books/">See what we've published</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
